# PocketSmart AI

PocketSmart AI is an AI-powered budget recommendation assistant.

## Features

- Home Interior Planner
- Party Planner
- Jewelry Planner
- Budget-based recommendations
- Gemini AI integration
- FastAPI backend
- HTML frontend

## Technologies

- Python
- FastAPI
- Gemini AI
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Installation

Install dependencies:

pip install -r requirements.txt

Create a .env file:

GEMINI_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

Run the application:

uvicorn app.main:app --reload

Open:

http://127.0.0.1:8000

## Security

Never upload the .env file or your Gemini API key to GitHub.
